      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FOOTLOOSE (4) has a strong record this journey here with two wins and a minor from five starts. Scored by a nose last time (28.95) in a Grade 5/6 over 498m at this track. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. SMOOTH BLAST (7) made light work of the tricky draw with a fast early sectional but gathered in and had to settle for the minors, finishing third (28.58) at this track over 498m. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Overdue and is among the main hopes. MIZUKI HEART (8) boasts a strong record this journey here with three wins and four minors from nine tries. Below best last time at this track (21.96) in a Grade 4, finishing a 4 length fourth. Can hit the frame with the right run. RACCOON ROGER (6) was in the money last start here at this trip - likely to feature again.",
